  "notes": "Uncertain throughout. āśubhiḥ cit yān vi mucāti: 'even those whom he releases from the swift ones' (āśubhiḥ read as 'from the swift', the case sense is guessed). atamānam 'untiring' tentative. ahyarṣūṇām: 'gliding like snakes' tentative. nyayān 'downward ways' tentative. aviṣyām: form not understood; left untranslated (kept as aviṣyā). mokī 'release' (f.) tentative; alternative: a person 'the releaser'.",
